d over a century ago where clearances were significantly tighter. This oversight necessitated a 50-million-euro project to shave the edges of the platforms. Which country’s specific Gabarit error caused this national embarrassment?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:49:25Z", "username": "Nikunj", "text": "France??", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:49:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Italy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:49:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Correct. French national railway or SNCF", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:49:54Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Nice lurn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:49:57Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Scores: Arjun 10 Nikunj 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:50:13Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Yes that’s what I recall as well. He had no idea where he was going", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:50:47Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Tx", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:50:52Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Next:", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]